    "updated_at": "2025-01-15T01:55:10Z",
    "body": "I believe another fix would be to use the DOM manipulation task source in \"Try to scroll to the fragment\", to ensure that the task it queues runs before the task that fires the load event.\n\nWould you be able to investigate what browsers do today, e.g. by source inspection?",
