    "created_at": "2025-01-16T10:12:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-01-16T10:12:09Z",
    "body": "Setting it in the same task as `DOMContentLoaded` is dispatched would seem like a reasonable clarification for the case where we are dealing with a navigation to a new document. I would support trying to get the specification and implementations aligned on that.",
