    "body": "Hmm, what should happen when the element with the ID gets inserted after `DOMContentLoaded`? Or after `load`, even? I guess not matching is acceptable if that matches implementations, but perhaps they currently account for that somehow due to the rise in JavaScript-driven documents.",
